        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "8b6ced65-3c28-5b49-9f8a-961ae313d93f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joel Greenblatt, Michael O'Brien, Tom Waits, Warren Buffett, Charlie Munger, Bill Ackman, William Green\n- Companies: Pzena Investment Management\n- Books: The Face of Texas: Portraits of Texans, Hard Ground, The Great Minds of Investing\n- Concepts: Magic formula investing, value investing\n\nFacts:\n- Joel Greenblatt outlined magic formula investing as an investment technique that uses the principles of value investing.\n- In 2003, Michael O'Brien completed The Face of Texas: Portraits of Texans.\n- In 2011, Michael O'Brien completed Hard Ground, which pairs portraits of homeless individuals with poems by Tom Waits.\n- In 2014, The Face of Texas: Portraits of Texans was updated with 24 new photographs.\n- In 2015, Michael O'Brien completed The Great Minds of Investing, a collection of 33 portraits of famous investors.\n- The Great Minds of Investing includes portraits of Warren Buffett, Charlie Munger, Joel Greenblatt, and Bill Ackman, with accompanying profiles written by William Green.\n- Joel Greenblatt is also a director at Pzena Investment Management, a high-end value firm.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
