        "text": "Page: Magic formula investing. Sentence: Magic formula investing is a term referring to an investment technique outlined by Joel Greenblatt that uses the principles of value investing.\nPage: Joel Greenblatt. Sentence: He is also a director at Pzena Investment Management, a high-end value firm.\nPage: Michael O'Brien (photographer). Sentence: O'Brien has completed three books: \"The Face of Texas: Portraits of Texans\" (2003), updated with 24 new photographs in 2014; \"Hard Ground\" whose portraits of homeless individuals are paired with poems by Tom Waits (2011); and \"The Great Minds of Investing\" (2015), a collection of 33 portraits of famous investors such as Warren Buffett, Charlie Munger, Joel Greenblatt, and Bill Ackman, with accompanying profiles written by William Green.",
